{"unit_id":"MWGE22629__dsh-task-board#feature-workspace-lanes","repo":"MWGE22629/dsh-task-board","commit":"ff3f0638aafa32101e0e6fa085ce3dd0e1f3ea17","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Task Board 的功能「按工作区分区」：工作区可加入看板形成分区，卡片按所属工作区归类；分区支持拖拽排序，也可选择一至三行排列。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:904-916","client.js:1034-1044"]}
{"unit_id":"MWGE22629__dsh-task-board#feature-live-progress","repo":"MWGE22629/dsh-task-board","commit":"ff3f0638aafa32101e0e6fa085ce3dd0e1f3ea17","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Task Board 的功能「实时进度卡片」：运行中的卡片显示会话状态和 Host 汇总的活动摘要；看板每秒批量轮询正在运行的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:880-890","index.js:198-205"]}
{"unit_id":"MWGE22629__dsh-task-board#feature-floating-sessions","repo":"MWGE22629/dsh-task-board","commit":"ff3f0638aafa32101e0e6fa085ce3dd0e1f3ea17","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Task Board 的功能「浮动会话窗口」：打开卡片会在浮动层显示对应会话内容，窗口支持拖动和八向缩放，收起后卡片回到看板。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1404-1417","client.js:1420-1430"]}
{"unit_id":"MWGE22629__dsh-task-board#feature-resume-session","repo":"MWGE22629/dsh-task-board","commit":"ff3f0638aafa32101e0e6fa085ce3dd0e1f3ea17","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Task Board 的功能「继续已停止任务」：失败或停止状态的卡片提供继续操作；点击后插件短暂保留会话引用并发送一条继续提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:717-717","client.js:1947-1967"]}
